# Debugging this engine

Read `debug-notes.md` before diagnosing GC, parse, math, or correctness issues.

- Octane is **resolved** (9/9 runs). Use it as regression gate after fixes, not discovery.
- **Discovery:** run `./tests/difftest/run.sh` first (C reference at `../mquickjs/mqjs`).
- Phase 1A–1D static audit is **largely complete**; fix 13 (trig negatives) was found only by difftest.
- Compare only against `../mquickjs` (C). Do not search other workspace dirs.
- Build `-Doptimize=ReleaseFast`. Fix one bug per turn. Performance last.
- C `JS_POP_VALUE` assigns the GC-updated pointer back. Never discard `popValue` when the local is used after a GC-capable call.
- Do not revert fixes 1–13. Do not re-apply compact-by-len, MakeUniqueString post-resize extras, or global resize memcpy changes.
- `eval` global scope and `let`/`const` as `var` are **documented deviations** — not bugs.
- `mqjs tests/octane/run.js <suite>` segfaults (host argv). Use `tests/difftest/` or `/tmp/gc_stress_*.js` + `--memory-limit 8M`.
